                    - Cột <b>A</b>: IP &nbsp; <b>B</b>: Hostname &nbsp; <b>C</b>: Model &nbsp; <b>D</b>: Version &nbsp; <b>E</b>: Serial &nbsp; <b>F</b>: Image (bỏ qua) &nbsp; <b>G</b>: Error<br />
